Bilkul yar 👍 Ye save kar lo, next time sirf apne sticker folder ke andar Git Bash khol ke isi method ko follow karna hai:

🚀 GITHUB PAR SAARE PROJECT/PACK FOLDERS UPLOAD KARNE KA METHOD
Repository:
https://github.com/ayan6v/av6-stickrs.git
📁 Folder structure:
Desktop
└── stickers
    ├── pack1
    ├── pack2
    ├── pack3
    ├── pack4
    └── ...saare packs
1️⃣ stickers folder ke andar Git Bash kholo.
2️⃣ Agar repo pehli baar clone karni hai:
git clone https://github.com/ayan6v/av6-stickrs.git temp-repo
3️⃣ stickers ke andar ke saare pack/project folders
   temp-repo ke andar copy karo.
Agar automatically copy karna ho:
for d in */; do [ "$d" != "temp-repo/" ] && cp -r "$d" temp-repo/; done
4️⃣ Repo folder mein jao:
cd temp-repo
5️⃣ Saari files add karo:
git add .
6️⃣ Commit:
git commit -m "Add all sticker packs"
7️⃣ GitHub par upload:
git push origin main
✅ GitHub refresh karo.
Saare folders root par nazar aayenge:
pack1/
pack2/
pack3/
pack4/
...
packXX/
⚠️ Important:
- temp-repo ko dobara copy mat karna.
- GitHub par folders na aaye hon to pehle `git status` check karo.
- Upload chal raha ho to terminal band mat karo.
- Push complete hone ke baad hi temp-repo delete karo.

Next time agar temp-repo already bana hua ho, git clone wali command dobara mat chalana. Seedha folders copy karke cd temp-repo → git add . → git commit → git push karna.